n style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-d9fe0709-97d7-4e33-9297-848d2d8adec1\">이 공략은 현재 제가 클리어 되는 기준입니다!</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-389b346c-21f4-47aa-b14d-fe924ed08720\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-8889360f-2103-4f82-b33c-5c9398e294a1\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-f7da25ae-c482-4341-982e-5ad8b99ec8b8\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-05d862b9-432a-43b9-b7f5-740fdcf3d55b\">1. 보스를 한대 치고 &quot;&quot;7시&quot;&quot; 방향으로 빠지기</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-f38cc455-cb05-481e-9487-3d2dcf5a5aba\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-d8290501-6079-4f09-9a60-4b96f8489965\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-98c777fe-215e-4244-92c9-6da20b270b9b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-f7d52c03-a2e9-4a0e-aee5-44a4a50517be\">2. 빠진 후 &quot;&quot;53초&quot;&quot;에 첫 스킬을 쓰기에 그때 힐 또는 버프를 받으며 2번 책 줄 앞에서 기다리기</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-1226663e-f089-4291-8fb5-8e8a28ebaeb5\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-dd066a56-868d-40f7-8fe9-f57bb3a39a46\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-b4c4cc40-f350-4c33-9df6-ee504b68ad99\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-644be66d-0827-4cfe-81b3-8e675d3e9832\">3. 기존에 알려진 48초가 아닌 &quot;&quot;47.5 ~ 47초&quot;&quot;에 들어가기</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-d99d1169-c1ef-4d7f-b8c6-a0dea7282ae3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-67d2ebc7-94e0-474a-b158-5e04094dc417\">-&gt; 들어갈 때 핵심은 손을 떼는 것이 아닌 ★ 책 1~2줄 사이에 쿠키를 &quot;손컨&quot;으로 배치 (우유를 보면서 넣는다고 생각하면 시커도 자연스럽게 배치 됨)</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-f7d862eb-7249-4e61-b089-d701e1284fed\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-8095b102-88d5-4469-be6e-277aaaf05713\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-6a68b104-6f8c-45dd-a83c-86667ca9ed94\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-bfc4a7bc-9c9d-43e3-8259-5b3b7d046c0a\">4. 시커가 드론 2개를 띄우는 것을 보고 7시로 빠지기</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-947ce083-0133-4b88-b183-3e2899113bf6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-34f4dbeb-dbd2-46fe-b11a-49504692b1c3\">-&gt; 47초에 들어가게 되면 보스가 쿵 하면서 쿠키를 밖으로 밀어내버림</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-1c96107f-033f-4752-b126-3b72d4d473fc\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-7fdfea56-9e62-4156-8046-89306a5f14e6\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-9cbcc6b8-386a-427e-8150-f4004abc215d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-e3cbd88e-e95e-452a-8112-32b2639020aa\">5. 위에 딜이 잘 들어가면 깨지는 경우도 있지만 안 깨지면 반복</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-6391f475-6c14-448e-91d4-8e2ca2c53245\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-27066524-9bbd-4bfa-8788-b2de2f4a9802\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-5ddf7aaf-df96-4c3a-8bee-87bf15440b00\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-f767b193-8652-459c-abf3-ae49b7574c1d\">순서</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-f9fa7b40-dfc5-42f7-be05-9c654e974cbb\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-758e0e5d-4076-42ba-85c7-dc38b8c7fc7d\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-6c82311c-b905-4bbf-b82c-3ae697f2261c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-efb1a4d8-19d0-4322-ab2a-0eec1b54381b\">처음에 치고 시커가 드론 2개 띄우고 7시로 빠지기 -&gt; 53초에 버프 -&gt; 47초에 책 1~2줄 사이 손컨으로 들어가기 -&gt; 시커 드론 2개 띄우는거 보고 7시로 빠지기 -&gt; 32초에 다시 들어가기 -&gt; 빠지기 반복</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-3c79c27e-ba1e-4506-8376-efaf67aa2b1c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-b3622522-f8bb-4e84-85cf-0aadbe6555b3\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-2be7d5a5-7728-45c0-bfc4-ee5b145e63f6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-912593ba-3274-4444-9234-5b57b019b64a\">리트 필요 (저는 스테이지마다 2~3번 정도 리트함)</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-97708529-5e2d-4782-8570-257cc242717c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-487cde4d-7f55-4127-96dc-21f695661917\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-2bfb1c18-e670-4e12-97b5-a92acd671874\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-9544f152-1661-423c-a96e-d452327f19f1\">클리어 영상 참고</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-a8a9dbfb-d54b-417e-8fa5-3c177dfc73af\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-c1f7baaa-c9b5-4948-914f-1d8a3aa966ee\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-left\" >\n                                <div clas